tools.description:
Places a bid in the auction
        @param prompt The prompt string for the AI art generation
        @dev Must send ETH value higher than current highest bid

Returns the bid amount for a specific bidder
        @param bidder The address of the bidder
        @return The bid amount for the bidder

Returns the image URI for a given image ID
        @param image_id The ID of the image to query
        @return The image URI string

Returns the image ID owned by a given address
        @param owner The address of the owner
        @return The image ID owned by the address

Updates the image generation status
        @param token_id The ID of the token being generated
        @param active Whether generation is active or complete
        @dev Can only be called by the AI seller

Initializes the auction contract
        @param starting_bid The minimum starting bid amount
        @dev Can only be called once
